unwrapping seperately. The data should be between -Pi and Pi.\nUnwrapSplit[] \
is based on DOI: 10.1364/AO.46.006623 and 10.1364/AO.41.007437.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/UnwrapSplit"|>, 
