of the spin system din given the hamiltonian ham using ex Degree exitation \
and ref Degree refocus pulses.\\nSequenceTSE[din ,ham, {te, necho}, {ex, \
ref}, b1] performs a multi echo spin echo experiment with echo time te with \
necho echos of the spin system din given the hamiltonian ham using ex Degree \
exitation and ref Degree refocus pulses and b1.\\nThe te is defined in ms, \
the ex and ref are defined in degree and b1 of 100% is defined as 1. \\nThe \
output is a new spinsystem dout.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
             StripOnInput->False,
             LineSpacing->{1.5, 1.5, 3.}],
