has dimensions {z, {tr1,tr2}, x, y}.\nB1MapCalc[dataTr1, dataTr2, TR, alpha] \
where dataTr1 and and dataTr2 can have any dimensions.\n\nThe Output can be \
\"Map\", \"MagPhase\", or \"Complex\"}\n\nB1MapCalc[] is based on DOI: \
10.1002/mrm.21120.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/B1MapCalc"|>, 
    "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> None, "DownValues" -> None, 
