    "CreateT2Dictionary[{T1m, T1f}, {nEcho, detlaTE}, angle] Creates a EPG \
signal dictionary used for EPGT2fit.\nEvery dictionary that is defined is \
cached.\n\nThe output is in units as defined by the detlaTE, e.g. if detlaTE \
is in ms the output is in ms.\nThe TR and TE should be in the same units as \
Dela.\n\nOutput is {dictionary, vals}.", 
