tracts based on the list of select criteria.\\nSelect criteria are defined as \
{\\\"logic\\\",{\\\"how\\\", criteria}}.\\nThe \\\"logic\\\" parameter can be \
\\\"and\\\", \\\"or\\\" and \\\"not\\\".\\nThe \\\"how\\\" parameter can \
be:\\n\\t- \\\"x\\\", \\\"y\\\", or \\\"z\\\" for slice selection, here \
criteria is a slice number\\n\\t- \\\"thourgh\\\" for selecting tract that go \
through a roi, here criteria is a 3D mask.\\n\\t- \\\"within\\\" for \
selecting tract that fit fully within the roi, here criteria is a 3D mask.\\n\
\\t- \\\"partwithin\\\" for selecting the part of the tracts that fall within \
the roi, here criteria is a 3D mask.\\nAny number of select criteria can be \
listed.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
